# Cross-origin isolation for every response — without COOP/COEP the browser
# refuses SharedArrayBuffer/Memory64 and the in-tab checker cannot start.
# Applied by Workers static assets (and Cloudflare Pages) even when a
# request is served before the worker script runs; infra/worker.js sets the
# same headers for the R2-backed artifact paths.
# SEC1: Content-Security-Policy connect-src — the page and its workers
# connect to this origin, blob: and data: only (infra/worker.js
# CONTENT_SECURITY_POLICY says why; infra/worker.test.mjs pins this line).
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin
  Content-Security-Policy: connect-src 'self' blob: data:
